        start.elapsed(),
        rss_before,
        rss_after
    );

    // Return a tuple containing whether the compilation was successful and the exit code.
    (exit_code.status.success(), exit_code.status.code().unwrap())
}

struct Logger {
    hook: Box<dyn FnMut(Level, &str) + Send + Sync>,
}

impl Logger {
