Here is an example of a robust, scalable C++ application that processes real-time sensor data streams from a diverse set of IoT devices, integrates with Kafka and AWS Kinesis for asynchronous data ingestion, prioritizes Kafka for its reliability and flexibility but also supports Kinesis for low-latency capabilities, manages up to 15,000 concurrent data streams, and includes a flexible logging mechanism, monitoring and alerting system, testing strategy, CI/CD pipeline, and modular architecture:
```c++
#include <iostream>
#include <vector>
#include <map>
