To avoid redundant certificate retrieval and mitigate potential network latency issues, this function incorporates a caching mechanism that supports different expiration times based on certificate updates with a configurable grace period. The cache is designed to be thread-safe and synchronize primitives are used to prevent race conditions and ensure atomic operations when updating cache entries.

