The file processing component will be responsible for parsing, validating, and filtering incoming files. It will use a JSON parser library to extract data from the files and validate it against a schema. If any errors are found, the middleware service will handle them appropriately. The service will also perform any necessary transformations on the data before passing it on to the backend service.
