The class has several methods that can be overridden by subclasses: `executeCommand`, which executes a single shell command; `deleteFiles`, which deletes up to 1000 specified files in a target directory before executing the command; and `parseFilesForDeletion`, which parses the command to determine which files to delete. These methods can be used to modify the behavior of the class for specific use cases.

