* A `addReplicationPolicy` method to add a new replication policy to the system.
* A `removeReplicationPolicy` method to remove a replication policy from the system.
* A `getReplicationPolicy` method to get the replication policy with the given ID.
* An `addFile` method to add a new file to the system.
* A `removeFile` method to remove a file from the system.
* A `getMetadataEntry` method to get the metadata entry for a given file.
