The inventory management service uses the `inventory-manager` library to manage inventory, while the payment gateway service uses the `paypal-client` and `stripe-client` libraries to process payments using PayPal and Stripe respectively. The fraud detection service uses the `fraud-detection` library to detect fraud in payment details.

