The `modifyFileAndInitializeRecords` function first retrieves the file configuration from the external service using the `ConfigurationService`. It then dynamically appends a sequence of random digits to the filename's extension based on the file type, ensuring that the appended digits match half the length of the filename's name part (rounded up).

